{"id":"wb-1-139","name":"半坡遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"半坡遗址","text":"半坡遗址位于中华人民共和国陕西省西安市灞桥区半坡村，地处浐河下游右侧覆盖有黄土的二级阶地上，背依白鹿塬，与河床相距800米。半坡遗址是中国黄河流域新石器时代仰韶文化的村落遗址典型代表，至今已有六七千年的历史。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%8A%E5%9D%A1%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":94902639,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94902639","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/565841cd93981fa9d58ecb0a.jpg","title":"Banpo_Museus.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Banpo_Museus.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/52/Banpo_Museus.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"原上传者为中文維基百科的Dirrival","license":"CC BY-SA 2.5","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.5","caption":"​西安半坡博物馆。","width":320,"height":240}}